### GET with param and req.id
GET /items/42
=> 200

{"method": "GET", "id": "42", "reqId": "<any string>"}

### POST with custom response header
POST /items

{"name": "Lantern"}
=> 201
x-created: true

{"method": "POST", "name": "Lantern"}

### PUT
PUT /items/42

{"name": "Torch"}
=> 200

{"method": "PUT", "id": "42", "name": "Torch"}

### PATCH
PATCH /items/42

{"name": "Candle"}
=> 200

{"method": "PATCH", "id": "42", "name": "Candle"}

### DELETE
DELETE /items/42
=> 200

{"method": "DELETE", "id": "42"}

### Unmatched method on known path returns 404 realm message
DELETE /readonly
=> 404

{"error": "ROUTE NOT FOUND IN THIS REALM"}
